                "reply_count": 101,
                "retweet_count": 67,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "While most parents can keep their kids on their insurance until age 26, that\u2019s not true for military families on TRICARE. Servicemembers have earned high-quality, affordable health care for themselves and their families and there\u2019s no reason why their benefits shouldn't be the same as private plans. Our bipartisan Healthcare Fairness for Military Families Act will fix this.",
