                "retweet_count": 47,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "60 years ago today, Medicare and Medicaid were created to provide affordable health care for American seniors and working families. Now they\u2019re under attack, and millions of Americans could soon lose their Medicaid coverage because of Trump\u2019s big bill. In the richest country in the history of the world, no one should go bankrupt getting the care they need.",
