                "retweet_count": 33,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": ".@MartinOMalley and I heard from folks directly hurt by Trump\u2019s bill at a town hall in Tucson yesterday. Cuts to Medicaid and threats to Social Security and Medicare put Arizonans and their families at risk. I\u2019m fighting to protect the benefits they\u2019ve earned. https://t.co/QKRqxNMYuT",
