                "retweet_count": 317,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Next year, premiums are expected to rise by an average of 26% for Arizonans with health insurance through the Affordable Care Act. That\u2019s going to hit families hard.\n\nAll because Donald Trump and Congressional Republicans\u2019 passed a law that gave tax breaks to rich people paid for by working Americans. But the fight isn\u2019t over. Congress can still act to stop these hikes and protect your health care.",
