                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thank you to @MayorGallego and all the community leaders who joined us to talk about Medicaid in Phoenix. With more than 300,000 Arizonans at risk of losing their insurance because of Trump and Republicans\u2019 big bill, it\u2019s critical for us to work together to protect folks\u2019 health care.",
