                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "RFK Jr. is lying to the American people. Two months ago to the day, Donald Trump signed his big bill cutting Medicaid by nearly $1 trillion.\n\nToday, our country's leading health official is pretending those cuts don't even exist.",
