                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicare is testing AI in 6 states, including Arizona, to decide who gets care. Over a million Arizonans count on Medicare. Under Trump and RFK Jr.\u2019s plan,\u00a0AI companies will profit off denying care to seniors. This is wrong. Seniors deserve better.",
