                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Dennis wrote my office to tell me how much the ACA tax credits mean to him and his wife. I called him back to learn more. He\u2019s on Medicare, but his wife\u2019s premiums could jump from $440 to $1,100 a month without the tax credit. That\u2019s going to eat away at the retirement they\u2019ve been saving for all their lives. I\u2019m fighting for people like them.",
